  "_comment": [
    "Cell descriptor for layout/bin/compose-cell.py (issue #220). See layout/opamp_core/README.md.",
    "SCOPE: opamp_core assembled from the four committed sub-block GDS files (blocks[].cell, #210):",
    "opamp_bias, opamp_stage1, opamp_out, opamp_comp. Inter-block nets d2, tail are routed here; d1 and cz",
    "stay inside their sub-blocks (lvs.internal_nets, not core pins). Boundary pins: vdd vss inn inp out ibias.",
    "rel_vss: 8 um li1 relay overlapping the stage1 vss stub so the vss route drops 8 um clear of the inn pin stack.",
    "inn/inp waypoints steer the routes north out of the crowded west side of stage1.",
    "Inherits the opamp_comp Magic drc(full) resistor-head failure (layout/opamp_comp/README.md)."
